  "bodyHash": "6fd69d822c3048dd",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">《One Piece Craft》最初是專為好友們設計的整合包，但由於許多玩家熱切期盼體驗這款整合包所帶來的航海、操控魔法與持槍冒險，以及《海賊王》的核心精神，您現在也能親自體驗 OPC 的魅力。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">擁有眾多特色功能，例如可自由建造船隻（此功能由 </span><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mods/minecraft/profiles/570e4f53-8e56-45f8-a4da-556af513a9d0/addons/76474\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Archimedes' Ships</span></a><span style=\"font-weight:400\"> 模組提供）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">可透過正規途徑獲得惡魔果實，並能外出探索發現由 </span><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mods/minecraft/profiles/570e4f53-8e56-45f8-a4da-556af513a9d0/addons/78726\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mine Mine no Mi</span></a><span style=\"font-weight:400\"> 所提供的強大能力&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">可透過 </span><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mods/minecraft/profiles/570e4f53-8e56-45f8-a4da-556af513a9d0/addons/32274\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">JourneyMap</span></a><span style=\"font-weight:400\"> 自由且安全地探索海域&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">以及眾多其他便利性模組，這些模組均經評估認為對於還原《海賊王》風格至關重要。您可以於下方找到本整合包所包含的所有模組列表：</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">◦ </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archimedes-ships\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Archimedes' Ships</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">◦ </span><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mods/minecraft/profiles/570e4f53-8e56-45f8-a4da-556af513a9d0/addons/228027\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">BiblioCraft</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">◦ </span><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mods/minecraft/profiles/570e4f53-8e56-45f8-a4da-556af513a9d0/addons/78778\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Chest Transporter</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">◦ </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Cosmetic Armor Reworked</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">◦</span><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mods/minecraft/profiles/570e4f53-8e56-45f8-a4da-556af513a9d0/addons/32274\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">JourneyMap</span></a><span style=\"font-weight:400\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">◦ </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mine-mine-no-mi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mine Mine no Mi</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">◦ </span><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mods/minecraft/profiles/570e4f53-8e56-45f8-a4da-556af513a9d0/addons/241160\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">NetherPortalFix</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">◦ </span><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mods/minecraft/profiles/570e4f53-8e56-45f8-a4da-556af513a9d0/addons/221418\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Perfect Spawn</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">◦</span><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mods/minecraft/profiles/570e4f53-8e56-45f8-a4da-556af513a9d0/addons/70833\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Recycle Items Plus</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fscalacube.com%252fp%252f_hosting_server_minecraft%252f1913827\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br><br><br></span></a></p>",
